# What EAS Build excludes from the source archive.
#
# Why this file exists: `google-services.json` is gitignored (it is a real
# credential and is deliberately not committed), but `app.json` names it in
# `android.googleServicesFile`, so the build needs it in the upload. With no
# `.easignore`, EAS falls back to `.gitignore` and the file is dropped —
# prebuild then fails, or worse, ships an Android build with no FCM.
#
# So this mirrors `.gitignore` with that one line removed. Keep the two in step
# when either changes. Build from the working tree with EAS_NO_VCS=1 so the
# local copy of the credential is what gets archived.

# dependencies
node_modules/

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

# Native
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# Metro
.metro-health-check*

# debug
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# macOS
.DS_Store
*.pem

# local env files
.env*.local

# Google Play service account key — never upload
*service-account*.json
fcm-service-account.json

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude
design
docs

# NOTE: google-services.json is deliberately NOT listed — see the header.
